Countersign
===========

Copyright (c) 2026 Kiter (PhiBao). MIT licensed.

This repository vendors and depends on:

- Switch (https://github.com/sandbox-quantum/switch), Apache-2.0 with
  Commons Clause. `docker-compose.yml` is the standalone Compose contract
  published by the Switch project, pinned to server 0.31.0.
- Mattermost Team Edition, used as the bundled chat surface of the local
  Switch stack.
- OpenCode (https://opencode.ai), invoked as the fixer's coding agent. Not
  bundled; the operator installs and authenticates it separately.

All dependencies keep their own licenses. The MIT license above applies to
Countersign's original code; the vendored Switch compose file remains under
Switch's Apache-2.0 with Commons Clause terms.

The `demo/orders` crate is original code written for this submission. Its
bug is deliberate and documented in the README.
